    */
    /* CLMUL reduction (Gueron): 
       poly = 0x...e1 in the low dword of a reflected constant.
       From https://www.intel.com/content/dam/www/public/us/en/documents/white-papers/carry-less-multiplication-instruction-paper.pdf
       page 20, "Algorithm 2" adapted. I'll instead implement reduction by a second
       schoolbook using the 128-bit polynomial constant via two clmuls, which is exact
       and still fast.
    */
    (void)folded; (void)lo;
    return hi;
